8.3 Configure SonarQube environment variables
On your Linux machine:

export SONAR_HOST_URL="http://YOUR-EC2-PUBLIC-IP:9000"

export SONAR_TOKEN="YOUR_GENERATED_TOKEN"

echo $SONAR_HOST_URL


8.4 Execute Maven SonarQube analysis
Go to your Maven project:

cd ~/maven-sonarqube-project/employee-management

mvn clean verify

mvn org.sonarsource.scanner.maven:sonar-maven-plugin:5.5.0.6356:sonar \
-Dsonar.projectKey=employee-management \
-Dsonar.host.url=$SONAR_HOST_URL \
-Dsonar.token=$SONAR_TOKEN


